WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
EJohannesburg, languta rirhangu rero ra timitara timbirhi hi nhlikanhi.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Exikarhini xa ximumu dyambu ri fika eka 87°. Rirhangu ri endla ndzhuti wo koma.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Loko vuxika byi tshinela, dyambu ra nhlikanhi ri va ehansi. Ndzhuti wu leha wu kongoma edzongeni.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Exikarhini xa vuxika dyambu ri fika eka 40°. Ndzhuti wu leha kwalomu ka 2.4 m.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Laha hi vuxika ndzhuti wu le tlhelweni ra xinene, edzongeni. Mubhedhi wa le ximatsini, en’walungu, wu kuma dyambu.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Byala swimilana leswi komeke etlhelweni ra n’walungu ra rirhangu leri leheke.
